hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2212","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein sab Jannat mein daakhil hongey magar jo inkaar karey. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aur kaun inkaar karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo meri itaat karey wo Jannat mein daakhil hoga. Aur jo meri naafarmaani karey us ne inkaar kya. (Bukhari: 7280)"
"2213","[AI-translation] Abdullah key betey Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Farishtey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey jabke Aap soey huey they. To un mein se baaz ne kaha: Beshak wo soey huey hain. Aur un mein se baaz ne kaha: Beshak aankh soi hui hai aur dil jaagta hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Beshak tumhaarey is saathi ki misaal hai, to uskey liye misaal bayan karo! To un mein se baaz ne kaha: Beshak wo soey huey hain. Aur un mein se baaz ne kaha: Beshak aankh soi hui hai aur dil jaagta hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Uski misaal us aadmi jaisi hai jo ghar banaaye aur us mein daawat rakkhey aur bulaaney wala bhejey. Phir jo bulaaney waley ko jawaab dey wo ghar mein daakhil hoga aur daawat mein se khaaeyga. Aur jo bulaaney waley ko jawaab na dey wo ghar mein daakhil na hoga aur daawat mein se na khaaeyga. To unhon-ne kaha: Use uski taabeer karo, wo use samjhey! To un mein se baaz ne kaha: Beshak wo soey huey hain. Aur un mein se baaz ne kaha: Beshak aankh soi hui hai aur dil jaagta hai. To unhon-ne kaha: Ghar Jannat hai. Aur bulaaney wala Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain. Phir jo Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki itaat karey us ne Allah ki itaat ki. Aur jo Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki naafarmaani karey us ne Allah ki naafarmaani ki. Aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon key darmiyaan farq hain. (Bukhari: 7280). Waqqaas key betey Saad se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Musalmaanon mein badey jurm wala wo hai jo cheez key baarey mein poochhey jo haraam nahi ki gai thi aur wo uskey sawal key sabab haraam ki gai. (7289). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"2214","[AI-translation] Maalik key betey Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Log poochhtey rahengey yahan tak ke kahengey: Ye Allah hai jo har cheez ka khaaliq hai. To Allah ko kis ne paida kya. (Bukhari: 7296)"
"2215","[AI-translation] Amr key betey Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah ilm ko uskey baad ke wo tumhey dey chuka hai kheencha hua nahi kheencta. Lekin use un se ulema key qabz key sath unkey ilm key sath kheencta hai. To jaahil log baaqi rahengey jin se fatwa poochha jaaeyga aur wo apni raey se fatwa dengey aur gumraah hongey aur gumraah karengey. (Bukhari: 7307)"
"2216","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Qiyaamat qaem na hogi yahan tak ke meri ummat pehli sadiyon key tareeqay par chaley, baalisht baalisht aur haath haath. To kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Faaris aur Room jaisey? To Aap ne farmaya: Aur logon mein unkey siwa kaun hain. (Bukhari: 7319)"
"2217","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Allah ne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko haq key sath bheja aur Aap par Kitaab naazil ki. To us mein jo naazil hua rajm ki aayat thi. (Bukhari: 7323)"
"2218","[AI-translation] Aas key betey Amr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jab haakim faisla karey aur ijtihaad karey, phir theek ho to uskey liye do ajr hain. Aur jab wo faisla karey aur ijtihaad karey, phir ghalti karey to uskey liye aik ajr hai. (Bukhari: 7352)"
"2219","[AI-translation] Abdullah key betey Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Allah ki qasam khaatey they ke Ibn Saaed Dajjaal hai. Main ne kaha: Tum Allah ki qasam khaatey ho? Unhon-ne kaha: Beshak main ne Umar ko Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas us par qasam khaatey huey suna hai aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use mana nahi kya. (Bukhari: 7355). Tauheed ki kitaab."
